      "side": 1,
      "message": "This CL stops squelching divide-by-zero errors (from sanitizers) in places that call SkScalarInvert. The only instances that popped up while testing locally were in GrOvalOpFactory, and I think both spots are safe. Those are now directly using ieee_divide, to maintain the suppression. All other call-sites are now potentially going to produce errors (eg, via fuzzing). I\u0027m signing up to investigate and fix any that arise.",
      "revId": "44c07eb71d25d9a0385b0defa3a7ea575418accc",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
